        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cec3fb8c-ffb5-3ead-b6ef-2b9df724a45d",
                "word": "deadname",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9b3aeae5-1e1a-441a-89db-d5fd93ed3b16",
                        "entry_id": "cec3fb8c-ffb5-3ead-b6ef-2b9df724a45d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "deadnames"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "721e8ace-02c0-4784-8267-0977c4c7579d",
                        "entry_id": "cec3fb8c-ffb5-3ead-b6ef-2b9df724a45d",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "dead name"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57c381d9-ba30-3ec9-85b9-0a38248b6ed6",
                        "entry_id": "cec3fb8c-ffb5-3ead-b6ef-2b9df724a45d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dans le cas d’une personne trans, prénom indiqué à l’état civil à la naissance, avant que la personne ne choisisse un nouveau prénom qui correspond mieux à son genre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9c86607-1ef7-46b5-a434-0f6f29ec1fba",
                                "sense_id": "57c381d9-ba30-3ec9-85b9-0a38248b6ed6",
                                "text": "Marion Lenne, députée de la 5e circonscription de la Haute-Savoie a également pris position dans un communiqué : \"La décision de la mairie de maintenir sur cette plaque le \"deadname\" de cette jeune femme … est un acte profondément irrespectueux de sa mémoire et qui ne peut qu’ajouter à la douleur de ses proches.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2740d4a-d8cf-4e73-8335-505e879b1b3b",
                                "sense_id": "57c381d9-ba30-3ec9-85b9-0a38248b6ed6",
                                "text": "Le réseau social [Twitter] a annoncé durcir sa politique en matière de transphobie. Désormais, le fait de mégenrer ou d’utiliser le deadname (le nom usité avant la transition de la personne) sera formellement interdit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4796e03c-e55f-46b0-9fa6-5ad78067e1e9",
                                "sense_id": "57c381d9-ba30-3ec9-85b9-0a38248b6ed6",
                                "text": "Des étudiant.e.s cessent de venir en cours pour ne plus entendre leur deadname (ou ancien prénom)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b174f196-c0d5-49f8-ac13-96647368d659",
                        "source_entry_id": "cec3fb8c-ffb5-3ead-b6ef-2b9df724a45d",
                        "source_sense_id": "57c381d9-ba30-3ec9-85b9-0a38248b6ed6",
                        "target_lang_word": "deadname",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deadname",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20ab6ecc-e662-37b3-ab73-b0ed409225d0",
                                        "entry_id": "d46fa298-ce90-35cc-85c4-719d74e756df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A previous name of a person (especially a transgender person) who has since changed their name."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "neologism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f65ef7a-35c5-40ad-9a29-8ca91fb365d5",
                                                "sense_id": "20ab6ecc-e662-37b3-ab73-b0ed409225d0",
                                                "text": "And when people constantly refer to you as your deadname [a name that you previously went by], or use the incorrect pronouns, it really is like getting slapped with a wet fish."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1af51eaf-43f2-4b6f-93c6-470d43cbadde",
                                                "sense_id": "20ab6ecc-e662-37b3-ab73-b0ed409225d0",
                                                "text": "One of the articles in our last issue contained a major error: we referred to a transgender student by their deadname."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab4536c7-e8a4-4fb6-b65b-980bfa3f94f0",
                                                "sense_id": "20ab6ecc-e662-37b3-ab73-b0ed409225d0",
                                                "text": "“My deadname is everywhere because of my ID card, and not only do I have to look at it but lots of other people get to see. […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fed8350-9cf4-4a39-8a70-065131732c17",
                                                "sense_id": "20ab6ecc-e662-37b3-ab73-b0ed409225d0",
                                                "text": "I know it hurts you when they look at you strange\nMisgender you intentionally, use your deadname"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "deadname",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b190c576-a46f-39d4-aa4c-347677f5c760",
                                        "entry_id": "a6056ee0-e2e1-3351-bd5b-0c40ef597311",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To refer to someone (especially a transgender person) who has changed names by a previous name."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf1828f9-c4ef-4937-9a72-4c96cff218df",
                                                "sense_id": "b190c576-a46f-39d4-aa4c-347677f5c760",
                                                "text": "Using trans peoples' dead names – names that they were born with which are either wrong through either legal or preferential means – has been and always will be an act of aggression, not just to the person you're deadnaming but to all trans people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1569deb2-a038-4e33-84bc-ec35a1976ab5",
                                                "sense_id": "b190c576-a46f-39d4-aa4c-347677f5c760",
                                                "text": "\"Right now, it's unclear whether they are choosing to deadname me maliciously, or just can't be bothered to accommodate trans students in the way we require them to,\" he said."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54af1aab-4649-4980-8aff-75a2736e8f63",
                                                "sense_id": "b190c576-a46f-39d4-aa4c-347677f5c760",
                                                "text": "Felix's dad deadnames him despite supporting his top surgery and hormone therapy, and he hates his mom for leaving when he was 10."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "defde3c6-a0e4-46ba-8cd7-701d7e924280",
                        "source_entry_id": "cec3fb8c-ffb5-3ead-b6ef-2b9df724a45d",
                        "source_sense_id": "57c381d9-ba30-3ec9-85b9-0a38248b6ed6",
                        "target_lang_word": "deadname",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deadname",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e1c9d1a-9bf2-3a89-b096-177640882979",
                                        "entry_id": "9ac163f3-ba76-3398-9bcc-a1529b3b9b0b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "imię nadane osobie, która okazała się być transpłciowa lub niebinarna, po jej narodzinach, a którego ta osoba przestała używać"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecec408a-99b2-41b7-89c7-f310966c0707",
                                                "sense_id": "4e1c9d1a-9bf2-3a89-b096-177640882979",
                                                "text": "Nie piszemy o Caitlyn Jenner w formie męskiej i używając jej deadname'u, czyli imienia, którego używała przed tranzycją, nie piszemy o siostrach Wachowskich per „bracia” i nie piszemy o Annie Grodzkiej, używając jej dawnych danych. O Margot piszmy zgodnie z jej identyfikacją"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
